  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making democratization reality in MX through improved access to abortion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mexico Igualitario is a decentralized collaborative platform that seeks to strengthen the LGBTIQ+ movement and the movement for access to abortion through different strategies and programs.This project  is focused on promoting democratization for women and the LGBTIQ+ community in Mexico through strategies that expand access to civil, sexual and reproductive rights in five states in Mexico.</narrative>
  </description>
